      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Livepeer Agent demo\n\n1. Load a reference image into **LoadImage** (or just describe a shot for t2v).\n2. Open the **Qwen Chat** sidebar and write in plain language, e.g.:\n   *\"a 5 second clip, slow push in, she turns to camera and smiles\"*\n3. Qwen writes the shot-native prompt into the **Livepeer Agent Render** node, sets duration/quality and queues the workflow.\n4. The render runs on the **Livepeer network** (`minimax-h3-i2v` by default) — no local GPU needed for diffusion.\n5. The clip lands in `output/Livepeer/` and previews in the node. Ask the chat to *refine* it and re-render.\n\nTips: `capability` picks the model (auto = MiniMax H3). `seed` fixes a take for A/B. `api_key` can carry a Daydream `sk_` key — empty uses the demo balance."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Livepeer Agent demo\n\n1. Load a reference image into **LoadImage** (or just describe a shot for t2v).\n2. Open the **Qwen Chat** sidebar and write in plain language, e.g.:\n   *\"a 5 second clip, slow push in, she turns to camera and smiles\"*\n3. Qwen writes the shot-native prompt into the **Livepeer Agent Render** node, sets duration/quality and queues the workflow.\n4. The render runs on the **Livepeer network** (`minimax-h3-i2v` by default) — no local GPU needed for diffusion.\n5. The clip lands in `output/Livepeer/` and previews in the node. Ask the chat to *refine* it and re-render.\n\nTips: `capability` picks the model (auto = MiniMax H3). `seed` fixes a take for A/B. `api_key` can carry a Daydream `sk_` key — empty uses the demo balance."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
